Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.54,0:00:14.50,Captions 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(960,820)\fscx95}— 1983: The Canary Islands, Off the Northwest African Coast —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End No way we got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That treasure's been at the bottom\Nof the ocean for a hundred years!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now whatever's in it is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.47,0:00:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get it on the boat\Nbefore we start celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing looks too long and\Nnarrow to be a treasure chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do your job!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lifting it too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, on three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.41,0:00:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.07,0:00:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, crack it open, O 'Rish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like this thing\Nwas locked from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.07,0:00:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just bust it open!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.53,0:00:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's written on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D-I-O. D-I-O?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.93,0:01:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that someone's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.15,0:01:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just freaking open it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.95,0:01:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun's about to go down and I don't\Nwant to be counting treasure in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.73,0:01:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I hear ya. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.05,0:01:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get the blowtorch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then we can start\Ndividing up our loot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On a day like any other, a motorboat\Nwas found adrift and abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The craft was largely undamaged\Nand showed no signs of struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the galley,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.05,0:01:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three cups of coffee sat half-full,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and on deck, an iron chest,\Nits lock melted away,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.97,0:01:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lay open and empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the chest's unusual shelter-like\Nchambers baffled discoverers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who believed it to have once\Ncontained a vast treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But interest waned, and before\Nlong, the chest was forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.55,0:02:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo, 17 years old\Nand 195 centimeters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His father is a Japanese jazz\Nmusician, currently on tour.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.95,0:02:14.58,Captions 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,855)\fad(294,0)}— 1987: Japan —
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His mother is an American\Nof British descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, all of that is correct,\Nand Jotaro is definitely my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like all his\Nfriends call him Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess they decided to take\Nthe Joe from his first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.03,0:02:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,name and the Joe from his\Nlast name and combine them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that's really lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly how many people did Jotaro kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.91,0:02:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.33,0:02:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody said anything\Nabout him killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.75,0:02:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got into a fight, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, the thugs he tangled with\Nwere all armed with nunchucks and knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fought four punks, one being an\Nex-boxer, and he broke 15 of their bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.23,0:02:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he busted their balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry if that was crude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He put all of them in a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things could have gone a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got to be shown the\Nseverity of his actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:02:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.31,0:03:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real issue is what happened afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Copy this and pass it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.13,0:03:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to tell you, that son\Nof yours is a strange one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.53,0:03:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.73,0:03:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.07,0:03:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, you can thank me\Nby taking your kid home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, does that mean\Nyou're releasing him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't keep him in here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, ma 'am, I have to tell you,\Nyour Japanese is really quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how long have you\Nbeen living in Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 20 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that explains it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place has been overrun lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.53,0:03:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got an entire backlog of criminals\Nthat we aren't even able to find cells for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.73,0:03:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your son's just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw the ball to mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your best at that track\Nmeet tomorrow. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go out to eat and celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:04:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's as good as your cooking, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, Jotaro, Jotaro, Jotaro, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.53,0:04:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my face, you bitch!
