Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you he's a\Nvery sweet boy. He's just
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.71,0:04:27.59,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,522)\pos(192,870)}Episode 1: A Man Possessed by an Evil Spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not capable of doing\Nsomething so appalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey on your feet Kujo\Nyou're being released
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what part of go home don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mom, you can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be staying here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems I've been possessed\Nby an evil spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've no idea what'll make me do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During that fight, it took\Nall I had just to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:05:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do everyone a favor\Nand leave me in this cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, for crying out loud, do\Nyou see what I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trying to release\Nhim, but he refuses to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have to ask you this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but are you sure everything's\Nall right with your boy upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a hotel, you know, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let us change cells, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop lying about the evil spirit thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.83,0:05:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.79,0:05:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.07,0:05:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with\Na beer in a jail cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you even get that in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And sometimes it likes to bring me things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.19,0:05:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's reading Shonen Jump\Nwhile listening to a radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, I mean, how is this even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.55,0:05:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a major problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:05:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might not be enough to make\Nyou guys keep me locked up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll show you how\Nevil the spirit is anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe then you'll see why letting\Nme out of here is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my gun he has in his hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But howdy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't see it just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.77,0:06:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you guys didn't see my\Nevil spirit, then watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like there's someone behind me\Nthat bound itself to me not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's grandfather\NJoseph has strange powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's happening to my son?
