Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, Papa! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.49,0:07:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't believe you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.51,0:07:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're my one and only daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.87,0:07:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if you tell me you\Nneed me to be somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then just give me a day\Nand I'll cross the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Mom come?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.65,0:07:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't like me leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I just told Susie that it was\Nofficial Joestar Corporation business,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.43,0:07:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, the greetings over\Nlet go of me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't wanna it's been forever\Nsince you've held me look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.15,0:07:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.11,0:07:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a 45-year-old woman. Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh now you've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you clowns staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.23,0:08:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.23,0:08:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Holly, about Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.23,0:08:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure he used the word evil spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my poor little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the policeman said they\Ncouldn't see it, but I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he had a third arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then he reached out\Nand grabbed the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when this arm came out, no one\Nelse there could see it but you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.55,0:08:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.77,0:08:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And aside from Jotaro saying that\Nhe's been possessed, you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anything happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what do I do about Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says he won't leave that cell\Nuntil he finds the cause of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, there, my darling daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got Joseph Joestar with you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to worry. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's go see my grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro can explain this himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.63,0:09:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting spookier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got more stuff in his cell now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If something is possessing him,\Nit's definitely not something nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If word of this gets out to my superiors,\NI'll lose my job in a heartbeat for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's no longer your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking my grandson home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your grandson?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.07,0:09:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're better off just\Nstaying where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Convince him to leave him\Nwhere you're standing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.11,0:09:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take my chances!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now step aside and leave him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be held responsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.45,0:09:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your grandfather!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.87,0:09:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever's happened,\Nhe'll be able to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come out and talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.51,0:10:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.33,0:10:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think you can help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An old man like yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry you came all the way from New\NYork, but nobody can help me, Gramps.
