Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait that's the pinky from\Nmy prosthetic left hand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when was he able to take\Nit so Did you see it or
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even feel it that's the\Nevil spirit stay away from
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me or you'll Lose what's\Nleft of your life I've
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never seen anything like\Nthis he was able to Deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me right off the bat that's\Nunbelievable I'm afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.91,0:10:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what Jotaro's\Nevil spirit is. But I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't think explaining it\Nto him will do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll understand his situation much\Nbetter if he sees it with his own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.25,0:11:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, in order for him to\Ntruly know the danger he faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he needs to experience it physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Avdol, it's your turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to meet an Egyptian\Nfriend I met a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what you need to just\Nget my grandson to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this damn cell back off\Nyou look strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.23,0:11:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But do you really think\NI'd let someone chase me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.11,0:11:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of here just because\Nyou told them to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't work like that\Nin fact all you've done
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now is made me want to\Nstay here even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this may get\Na little bit rough but in
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a few minutes he'll be\Nriddled with so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he'll be begging you\Nto let him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do what you gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.01,0:11:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious! Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let you turn this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sip it, pig! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.15,0:12:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol also has what you'd\Ncall an evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An evil spirit under the\Ncomplete command of Avdol's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magician's Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arms, they're burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.13,0:12:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these evil spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Cujoh doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's he flattening himself\Nagainst the back wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.97,0:12:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But do you feel how hot\Nit's getting in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.51,0:12:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at those numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.15,0:12:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally shown itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:13:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the fact that it's so clearly\Nvisible means it's incredibly strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's able to make it\Nmanifest so distinctly well done your evil
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spirit is impressive too so tell me grandpa\Nyou know about these evil spirits of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,course I do Mr Joestar when you asked me\Nto help get your grandson out of this jail
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cell I had planned on going easy on the\Nboy But in light of his tremendous power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.77,0:13:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm reconsidering that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.57,0:13:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one misstep could\Nput us all in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me if you want me to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.23,0:13:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not, I'll resort to a use of force that\Ncan land your grandson in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.69,0:13:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, do what you gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.39,0:13:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red Bind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with this heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.67,0:14:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly, be a good girl and let\NPapa finish what he started, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.09,0:14:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The evil spirit is withdrawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heat is restricting his breathing,\Nwhich causes the evil spirit to weaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may seem like an evil\Nspirit, but it's far from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.35,0:14:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this thing you believe has\Npossessed you is actually
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a powerful vision created\Nby your own life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This vision will always\Nappear standing by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because of that, we call it a stand.
