Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.89,0:14:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember Aesop's fable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.09,0:14:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cold wind made the\NTraveler pull his coat tighter,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.33,0:14:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the heat forced him to admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to leave your cage now, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said it before, I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.15,0:14:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep hurting other people\Nwithout even knowing I'm doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:15:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until that stops, I'm staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.53,0:15:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet someone like\Nme, but if you keep this up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just broke the damn toilet! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's destruction of property!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.73,0:15:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say I didn't warn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you suddenly turn your back on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not done!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, he's left his jail cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've accomplished what\Nyou asked me to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now what you got me, huh? Not\Nexactly. I did have every intention of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.59,0:16:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sending you to the hospital but you're\Nstronger than i had expected and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.65,0:16:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if i kept going with this steel rod\Njust what would you have done do
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not underestimate my stand magician's\Nred it could have easily melted
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that rod midair into a worthless\Npuddle the power avdol has is exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same as yours. If you want to\Nknow more about this evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll need to leave this jail thank
