Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.37,0:16:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jotaro i'm glad you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finally left that awful jail cell why\Nare you such an annoying bitch. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.31,0:16:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how dare you address\Nyour own mother that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.97,0:17:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what kind of language is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And stop smiling, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll only encourage it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grandpa. One question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something that I can't\Nquite wrap my brain around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to know all about this evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.13,0:17:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spirit, the stand, whatever\Nyou want to call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do you know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I did come All the\Nway from New York to explain
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it to you but in order for\Nyou to fully Understand
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the whole history of it\NI must start from the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.43,0:17:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beginning this is Part of\Nthe legacy of the Joestar
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.39,0:17:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,family take a look at these
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pictures what Are these
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.55,0:17:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about that coffins a\Nhundred years old and four
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.57,0:17:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,years ago it was Pulled\Nout of the Atlantic off
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the coast of Africa. Okay.\NI did a little research.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.29,0:17:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandfather, Jonathan Joestar, your\Ngreat-grandfather, died while at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.65,0:18:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out this exact same coffin was\Non that boat with him when he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they discovered it four\Nyears ago, it was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.19,0:18:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know exactly what was inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol and I are trying to\Nlocate him as we speak. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.39,0:18:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting there was\Na person inside that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.97,0:18:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, how could a human being stay\Nburied underwater for a hundred years?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because that person is evil\Nincarnate and his name is Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that he has been awakened\Nfrom his hundred year slumber?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is our fate to fight that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.85,0:18:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell does that face mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't you turn your back on me\Nlike this has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, you old man, this face\Nmeans your story is so lame?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.99,0:18:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know you, but you\Nare one arrogant bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,old man, did you really expect me to\Nfall for an unbelievable story like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:18:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the story sounds far-fetched,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but wouldn't you also say our evil\Nspirits are equally unbelievable?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.69,0:19:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think what you want, but soon you\Nwill have no choice but to believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want me to tell you how I know that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio exists and why I've\Nchosen to go after him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the best way to explain it is to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.09,0:19:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, the truth of it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I myself had a rather startling\Nrevelation that prompted all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About a year ago, I suddenly\Nobtained a stand of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.45,0:19:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raps, what did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.51,0:19:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand!
