Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.75,0:19:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thorns that came out of my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.49,0:19:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can reveal faraway visions\Nand place them on film.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.01,0:19:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only downside is I have to bust a\N30,000 yen camera every time I use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:19:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:20:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.29,0:20:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're fine. Now go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run along. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a matter of seconds, a vision will\Nappear in this photograph, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.93,0:20:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it will reveal your very destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.19,0:20:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, Polly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have either of you ever taken the time to\Nlook carefully at the back of your necks?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.31,0:20:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You each have it, but you probably\Nnever thought much about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A birthmark shaped like a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turns out that we all have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.51,0:20:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.87,0:20:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell does all this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.23,0:20:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father died when I was young,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I asked my mother about it,\Nand she said he had one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.23,0:20:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that everyone from the Joestar
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bloodline is born with this\Nexact same birthmark. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just what the hell is going\Nto turn up in that photograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our destiny, a path that\Nuntil now has been unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm losing my patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.63,0:20:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just show me the damn photo already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio he shows up in all my spirit photos\Nand look what's just above his shoulder
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the neck of this bastard on down\Nis Jonathan Joestar my grandfather
