Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.77,0:21:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the Atlantic, all I know is what\NI've learned from my grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arina.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow Dio took over the body of my
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.13,0:21:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grandfather and survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.33,0:21:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this much I know is certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.77,0:21:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bastard is
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.87,0:21:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,currently hiding somewhere on\Nthe globe, plotting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.07,0:21:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's four years since he revived\Nand the reason my spirit photography
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and your evil spirit have manifested\Nsince is most likely connected to Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.95,0:21:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To society in general our gifts Are\Nconsidered a kind of psychic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.07,0:21:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had my stand since the\Nday I was born but your powers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.93,0:22:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seem bound to Dio's body or\Nrather Jonathan Joestar's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.45,0:22:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's some sort of invisible\Nstring that connects you all to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.93,0:22:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His rebirth is also your own awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.69,0:22:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sleeping powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.05,0:22:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol does this photograph give you any\Nindication to where he might be now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.47,0:22:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.87,0:22:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's hardly anything of\Nnote in the photo at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.05,0:22:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a closer look later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.37,0:22:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.27,0:22:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I sprang this\Nall on you out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.43,0:22:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head home now. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.03,0:22:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll be sticking\Naround for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.91,0:22:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mind if I stay at\Nyour place while I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.27,0:22:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, of course not, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.13,0:22:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.07,0:22:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.21,0:23:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just now, a most intense feeling like\Nsomeone somewhere is watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.35,0:23:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is Jonathan's descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This body is sending out some kind\Nof spiritual signal to his offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.77,0:23:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.69,0:23:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be my fate, but\Nfate must be purged.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.53,0:23:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've taken the first step.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.47,0:23:29.48,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode{I'M NOT EDITING THE PREVIEW. IF THIS MESSAGE IS STILL HERE, WAIT UNTIL EPISODE 2 IS EDITED AND WE'LL CHANGE THE LINES HERE TO MATCH}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.15,0:23:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.31,0:23:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is your goodbye kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.09,0:23:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Oryaki Akemi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.13,0:23:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just transferred here yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.09,0:23:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.05,0:23:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this look like a pen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.81,0:23:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The loser is always the evil one.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.49,0:23:42.49,Next Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,205)\fs110}Episode 2
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.49,0:23:42.49,Next Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,870)\fs110}Who Will Be the Judge!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.73,0:23:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you justice.

